  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: \"0.5.0\"\n  # Test suite run, shared by the openfold3 test blocks.\n  # 1) Test entry points (beware fix rocm's when we get it working in CF)\n  # 2) Fix an upstream problem in osx pytorch 2.14 conda package,\n  #    similar to https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/174680\n  # 3) Run the test suite, skipping tests that are known to be slow,\n  #    fail due to known causes, or require external resources\n  pytest_script: >-\n    run_openfold --help\n    &&\n    setup_openfold --help\n    &&\n    validate-openfold3-rocm && exit 1 || true\n    &&\n    python -c \"import pathlib, stat, torch;\n    p = pathlib.Path(torch.__file__).parent / 'bin' / 'torch_shm_manager';\n    p.exists() and p.chmod(p.stat().st_mode | stat.S_IXUSR | stat.S_IXGRP | stat.S_IXOTH)\"\n    &&\n    pytest -vvv --pyargs openfold3.tests\n    --durations=0 --durations-min=2.0\n    -k \"not test_inference_load_state_dict_benchmark_under_ten_seconds\n    and not test_colabfold_msa_server\n    and not test_model_checkpoint\n    and not test_model_runner\n    and not test_entry_points\n    and not test_of3_model\n    and not test_diffusion_module\n    and not test_pdb_tetrapyrrole_chain_resolves\"\n\nrecipe:\n  name: openfold3-split\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/aqlaboratory/openfold-3/archive/refs/tags/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 6a6f1d18fa96764b5f4613102da359a5b6df9868a16ccf33b10421548d9dc543\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  skip:\n    - win\n\noutputs:\n\n  # --- Production package, noarch-python\n  - package:\n      name: openfold3\n    build:\n      noarch: python\n      script:\n        - pip install . --no-deps --ignore-installed --no-build-isolation --no-cache-dir -vvv\n      python:\n        entry_points:\n          - run_openfold = openfold3.run_openfold:cli\n          - setup_openfold = openfold3.setup_openfold:main\n          - validate-openfold3-rocm = openfold3.entry_points.validate_rocm:main\n    requirements:\n      host:\n        - python ${{ python_min }}.*\n        - pip\n        - setuptools\n        - setuptools-scm >=8\n        - wheel\n      run:\n        - __unix  # upstream does not support Windows.\n        - python >=${{ python_min }}\n        - numpy\n        - scipy\n        - pandas\n        # --- Machine learning\n        - pytorch\n        - pytorch-lightning <=2.6.1\n        - ml-collections\n        # --- Handling molecules\n        - rdkit <2026  # pin might be removed soon, see https://github.com/aqlaboratory/openfold-3/issues/285\n        - biotite >=1.6,<2\n        - pdbeccdutils\n        - kalign-python\n        # --- Misc\n        - pyyaml\n        - ijson\n        - memory_profiler\n        - wandb\n        - func_timeout\n        - tqdm\n        - typing-extensions\n        - python-lmdb >=2.2.0\n        # --- Downloading stuff\n        - requests\n        - awscli\n        - awscrt >=0.24\n        - boto3\n        # --- Testing as first-class operation\n        - pytest\n        - pytest-regressions\n        - pytest-vcr\n    tests:\n       - python:\n           imports:\n             - openfold3\n             - openfold3.core.metrics.model_selection\n             - openfold3.core.model.primitives.activations\n             - openfold3.tests\n             - openfold3.tests.config\n           pip_check: true\n           python_version:\n             - ${{ python_min }}.*\n             - \"*\"\n       # Selected test suite, run against min python version\n       - script: ${{ pytest_script }}\n         requirements:\n            run:\n              - python ${{ python_min }}.*\n              - pytorch-cpu\n       # Selected test suite, run against latest python version\n       - script: ${{ pytest_script }}\n         requirements:\n           run:\n             - python *\n             - pytorch-cpu\n\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://openfold.io\n  repository: https://github.com/aqlaboratory/openfold-3\n  summary: OpenFold's Biological Structure Prediction Model based on DeepMind's AlphaFold 3\n  license: Apache-2.0 AND BSD-3-Clause AND MIT\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE\n    - LICENSE-biotite.rst\n    - LICENSE-colabfold\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - Emrys-Merlin\n    - jandom\n    - jnwei\n    - sdvillal\n",
